utton or pressing backtick (`` ` ``)\n\n### 4. **Tab Navigation Through UI Controls**\n**Status: NOT IMPLEMENTED**\n- No `tabindex` attributes found in any component\n- No explicit focus management for button groups in `GlassHUD.tsx`\n- Buttons exist but don't have proper tab ordering\n\n### 5. **Focus Management Code**\n**Status: NOT IMPLEMENTED**\n- No focus traps found for modals\n- No programmatic focus management (no `useRef` for focus)\n- No focus restoration when panels close\n- Only one `aria-label` found: in `UIToggleButton.tsx` for accessibility\n\n### 6. **Visible Focus Indicators in CSS**\n**Status: MINIMAL IMPLEMENTATION**\nOnly 2 files contain focus styles:\n\n**`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.css`** (line 58-61):\n```css\n.error-boundary-button:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid #00ffff;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n```\n\n**`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/SettingsPanel.css`** (line 243-246):\n```css\n.settings-select:focus {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  border-color: #61dafb;\n}\n```\n\n**Missing focus styles for:**\n- GlassHUD buttons (`.hud-button`)\n- Settings panel buttons (`.settings-button`)\n- Intro overlay button (`.enter-button`)\n- Victory screen button (`.victory-button`)\n- UI toggle button (`.ui-toggle-button`)\n- Close button (`.close-button`)\n\n## Currently Working Keyboard Shortcuts\n\nBased on code analysis:\n\n| Key | Action | Location |\n|-----|--------|----------|\n| `` ` `` (backtick) | Toggle Expert Settings panel | `Game.tsx` line 99-102 |\n| `G` | Toggle grid lines (PLANNING phase) | `Game.tsx` line 103-106 |\n| `Space` | Skip transition phase | `useTransition.ts` line 91 |\n| `Escape` | Skip transition phase | `useTransition.ts` line 91 |\n\n## Accessibility Documentation Status\n\nFrom `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` (lines 1398-1424):\n- Keyboard navigation is marked as **LOW priority** and **pending [ ]**\n- All keyboard navigation features are listed as not implemented\n- Focus management is listed as not implemented\n- Only reduced motion support is marked as completed [x]\n\n## Summary of Missing Features\n\n### Critical Missing:\n1. **Grid Keyboard Navigation** - No way to navigate or interact with grid using keyboard\n2. **Focus Indicators** - Most UI elements lack visible focus styles\n3. **Tab Navigation** - No tab order or tabindex for UI controls\n4. **Panel Focus Management** - No focus traps or restoration for modals\n\n### Secondary Missing:\n5. **Enter/Space for Cell Placement** - Cannot place cells with keyboard\n6. **Escape for Panel Closure** - Settings panel can't be closed with Escape\n7. **ARIA Labels** - Only 1 aria-label found for 30+ interactive elements\n8. **Logical Tab Order** - No sequential navigation through UI controls\n\nThe application is primarily designed for mouse/touch interaction with minimal keyboard accessibility considerations. The only robust keyboard functionality is for skipping transitions and toggling the settings panel.\n</task_result>","title":"Verify keyboard navigation implementation","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39a4659b8ffeHrQ71HMSoVaJ9i","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771233191493,"end":1771233330762}}}}
