/CanvasGrid.tsx` (219 lines)**:\n  - Canvas rendering with requestAnimationFrame\n  - Cell animation logic with easing functions (lines 118-129)\n  - Device pixel ratio handling (line 58)\n  \n  **No comments explain**:\n  - Why specific easing functions are used (cubic ease-out, quadratic ease-in)\n  - The animation frame cleanup strategy\n  - The intensity calculation for CSS custom properties (line 188)\n\n- **`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx` (477 lines)**:\n  - Multiple useEffect hooks with complex dependencies\n  - Interval-based simulation loop (lines 290-304)\n  - Performance-critical simulation step (lines 243-288)\n  \n  **No comments explain**:\n  - Why certain useEffects have specific dependencies\n  - The simulation step optimization strategy\n  - The tracked cluster reference management\n\n---\n\n### 4. API Documentation (JSDoc/TSDoc Style)\n\n**Finding: ❌ COMPLETELY ABSENT**\n\n**Searched for:** JSDoc/TSDoc comments (`/** ... */`)\n\n**Result:** Found **0 files** with JSDoc/TSDoc documentation\n\n**Examples of Undocumented APIs:**\n\nAll function exports lack any documentation:\n\n```typescript\n// movement.ts - No JSDoc for any of these:\nexport function findConnectedComponents(grid: GridType, generation: number): CellCluster[]\nexport function matchClusters(currentClusters: CellCluster[], previousTrackedClusters: TrackedCluster[]): Map<string, TrackedCluster>\nexport function trackClusters(...): TrackedCluster[]\nexport function calculateVelocity(history: { x: number; y: number }[]): { dx: number; dy: number }\nexport function classifyCluster(...): 'MOVER' | 'OSCILLATOR' | 'STATIC'\n\n// simulation.ts - No JSDoc:\nexport function countNeighbors(grid: GridType, row: number, col: number): number\nexport function applyRules(grid: GridType, rules: RuleSet): StepResult\nexport function stepSimulation(state: SimulationState): { ... }\n```\n\n**All exported functions** in the following files have **zero documentation**:\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/simulation.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/movement.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/scoring.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/flux.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/level.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/phase.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/interaction.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/useTransition.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/usePhaseTimer.ts`\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/useTripleTapGesture.ts`\n\n---\n\n### 5. Type Definitions Documentation\n\n**Finding: ❌ ABSENT**\n\n**File:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts` (116 lines)\n\n**All 20+ type definitions** lack documentation:\n\n```typescript\n// No JSDoc for any of these types:\nexport type GridType = number[][]\nexport type GamePhase = 'PLANNING' | 'COUNTDOWN' | 'RUNNING' | 'FINISHED'\nexport type InteractionMode = 'DRAW' | 'ERASE'\nexport type TransitionState = 'PLAYING' | 'FADING_OUT' | 'INTERSTITIAL' | 'FADING_IN' | 'READY'\n\nexport interface CellCluster {\n  id: string\n  cells: Set<string>\n  centroid: { x: number; y: number }\n  generation: number\n}\n\nexport interface TrackedCluster extends CellCluster {\n  centroidHistory: { x: number; y: number }[]\n  velocity: { dx: number; dy: number }\n  classification: 'MOVER' | 'OSCILLATOR' | 'STATIC'\n}\n\nexport interface SimulationState { ... }\nexport interface FluxState { ... }\nexport interface LevelConfig { ... }\nexport interface ScoringConfig { ... }\nexport interface ScoreState { ... }\nexport interface LevelProgression { ... }\nexport interface TransitionConfig { ... }\nexport interface MovementDetectionParams { ... }\nexport interface GridSizingParams { ... }\nexport interface AudioParams { ... }\nexport interface ExpertSettings { ... }\n```\n\n**Missing documentation explains:**\n- What `centroidHistoryLength`